      "data": {
        "text": "**Choosing LLM Provider**\n\nI've decided to move forward with Google's Generative AI, either Vertex AI or the Gemini API, for the hosted LLM. The next step is to nail down the specifics of the implementation.\n\n\n**Defining Python Implementation**\n\nI'm now fully committed to the Gemini API via the `google-generativeai` library. I'll focus on crafting the `answer_with_context.py` script. The code will import the necessary library, define the function taking the question and context, call the LLM, and return the response. I'll ensure the provider is clearly identifiable in the script and that the file resides in the current working directory.\n\n\n",
