      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Implementation**\n\nI'm currently focused on solidifying the implementation strategy for summarizing text via a hosted LLM. I've decided to proceed using the OpenAI API as a concrete example and will ensure its identifier is clearly embedded in the `summarize_text.py` file. I'm moving toward building out a basic framework.\n\n\n**Outlining the Structure**\n\nOkay, I've got a firm grasp on the overall structure now. I'm building out `summarize_text.py`. It'll use the OpenAI API. I'm finalizing the details on the function, including the input text and the placeholder for the API key, typically obtained from an environment variable. The function will call the model `gpt-3.5-turbo`. I'm starting to build a basic framework.\n\n\n",
